# Template of .onsite_env. make_env.py copies it, then fills everything under the GENERATED line.
# Keep it private: it ends up holding every link. The repo is public.

# The camera-ready Drive folders, shared by link:
DRIVE_FOLDER_LBD=https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/example-LBD-folder
DRIVE_FOLDER_MIREX=https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/example-MIREX-folder

# Extra rows for the links table:
#   LINK_<anything>=group | name | url | description
# LINK_WIFI=Venue | Wi-Fi portal | https://example.com | Conference Wi-Fi sign-in
